struct DSU{vector<int>p;DSU(int n):p(n,-1){}int find(int x){return p[x]<0?x:p[x]=find(p[x]);}bool join(int a,int b){a=find(a);b=find(b);if(a==b)return false;if(p[a]>p[b])swap(a,b);p[a]+=p[b];p[b]=a;return true;}};
ll pw(ll x,ll n){ll r=1;for(;n;n>>=1,x=x*x%P)if(n&1)r=r*x%P;return r;}
ll det(vector<vector<ll>>a){ll r=1;int n=a.size();for(int i=0;i<n;i++){int j=i;while(j<n&&!a[j][i])j++;if(j==n)return 0;if(j!=i){swap(a[i],a[j]);r=P-r;}r=r*a[i][i]%P;ll iv=pw(a[i][i],P-2);for(j=i+1;j<n;j++){ll z=a[j][i]*iv%P;for(int k=i;k<n;k++)a[j][k]=(a[j][k]-z*a[i][k]%P+P)%P;}}return r;}
struct Tree{int n,L;vector<vector<int>>g,up;vector<int>pa,dep,ord,sz,heavy,head,pos;Tree(int n):n(n),g(n),pa(n,-1),dep(n),sz(n,1),heavy(n,-1),head(n),pos(n){}void edge(int a,int b){g[a].push_back(b);g[b].push_back(a);}void build(int root=0){pa[root]=root;ord={root};for(int z=0;z<(int)ord.size();z++){int v=ord[z];for(int u:g[v])if(u!=pa[v]){pa[u]=v;dep[u]=dep[v]+1;ord.push_back(u);}}L=1;while((1<<L)<=n)L++;up.assign(L,vector<int>(n));up[0]=pa;for(int k=1;k<L;k++)for(int v=0;v<n;v++)up[k][v]=up[k-1][up[k-1][v]];for(int z=n-1;z>0;z--){int v=ord[z],p=pa[v];sz[p]+=sz[v];if(heavy[p]<0||sz[v]>sz[heavy[p]])heavy[p]=v;}int timer=0;for(int v:ord)if(v==root||heavy[pa[v]]!=v)for(int u=v;u!=-1;u=heavy[u]){head[u]=v;pos[u]=timer++;}}
int jump(int v,int k){for(int j=0;j<L;j++)if(k>>j&1)v=up[j][v];return v;}int lca(int a,int b){if(dep[a]<dep[b])swap(a,b);a=jump(a,dep[a]-dep[b]);if(a==b)return a;for(int k=L-1;k>=0;k--)if(up[k][a]!=up[k][b]){a=up[k][a];b=up[k][b];}return pa[a];}
vector<int>path(int a,int b){vector<int>x,y;while(a!=b){if(dep[a]>=dep[b]){x.push_back(a);a=pa[a];}else{y.push_back(b);b=pa[b];}}x.push_back(a);reverse(y.begin(),y.end());x.insert(x.end(),y.begin(),y.end());return x;}};
struct F{ll a=1,b=0;};F cat(F x,F y){return{y.a*x.a%P,(y.a*x.b+y.b)%P};}struct V{F f,r;};V mergev(V x,V y){return{cat(x.f,y.f),cat(y.r,x.r)};}struct Seg{int n;vector<V>a;Seg(int z){for(n=1;n<z;n*=2);a.resize(n*2);}void setv(int p,F v){p+=n;a[p]={v,v};for(p/=2;p;p/=2)a[p]=mergev(a[p*2],a[p*2+1]);}V get(int l,int r){V x,y;for(l+=n,r+=n;l<r;l/=2,r/=2){if(l&1)x=mergev(x,a[l++]);if(r&1)y=mergev(a[--r],y);}return mergev(x,y);}};
